  "description": "An onslaught of lewd, gloomy, and shadowy tops is coming your way! Lewd Invasion is landing now! \n\n(Source: Mr.Blue, translated) \n\n1-5. **Seongsilhan Chaemuja?** (성실한 채무자?, The Diligent Debtor) \\[Pisangu\\]\n6-13. **Hyeongjeae** (형제애, Brotherly Love) \\[Matryo x Dallineungicha\\]\n14-19. **Emotion** (이모션) \\[Jakpil\\]\n20-24. **Appawa Na** (아빠와 나, Daddy and I) \\[Bammandeuk\\]\n25-31. **Soranseureoun Hanbame** (소란스러운 한밤에, On a Restless Night) \\[Charyeok\\]\n32-39. **Sokkupchingurang Toema Jung♥︎** (소꿉친구랑 퇴마 중♥︎, Exorcising With My Childhood Friend ♥︎) \\[Huin Yangmal\\]\n40-45. **Nae Geot** (내 것, You're Mine) \\[Geonwon\\]\n46-51. **Digging** (디깅) \\[37\\]\n52-56. **Angaeseoryeo Jeopdongulmyeon** (안개서려 접동울면, When the Cuckoo Cries in the Mist) \\[To-Di Bae\\]",
